{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a free fan work of <i>Metal Max</i>. The project was initiated in 2010 as a War3 RPG map, undergoing three complete overhauls during development. Constrained by the technical limitations of the War3 engine, the team had to migrate to a new engine and is now completely reconstructing it on Unreal Engine 4. The game features traditional turn-based combat, random encounters (both visible and invisible), and a dual-system for close-quarters battles and tank warfare.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848180/extras/c38e111b4b26e3eecb3b84777534540b.avif?t=1771117158\" width=640 height=348 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848180/extras/7a88ab3fe40ab3fc3137f57e7675df2b.avif?t=1771117158\" width=640 height=288 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u53d8\u5f02\u94a2\u94bb\u9f20","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3848180/4c0e5f442d61411a73bb06cca8563b7c1d6d326b.jpg"},{"name":"\u87f9\u6316\u6398\u673a","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3848180/59ae2dbe43ec3c6c84b560f34539ef45cc087763.jpg"},{"name":"\u53d8\u9690\u907f\u5f79","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3848180/44123d29b06c063e1600156d1ee8f8e477667607.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3848180?t=1771117158","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3848180?t=1771117158","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848180/8c39686809f96dabadc37d57e3a8b47c567428fc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771117158","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848180/8c39686809f9